{"status": "ok", "message-type": "work", "message-version": "1.0.0", "message": {"indexed": {"date-parts": [[2025, 11, 6]], "date-time": "2025-11-06T16:11:02Z", "timestamp": 1762445462785}, "reference-count": 0, "publisher": "Shuangqing Academic Publishing House Limited", "issue": "1", "content-domain": {"domain": [], "crossmark-restriction": false}, "short-container-title": ["JSSC"], "published-print": {"date-parts": [[2014, 1, 19]]}, "abstract": "<jats:p>在农村地区，众多农民选择进城务工，由于现实条件的限制,绝大多数外出的务工人员孩子无法同期跟随，成为留守儿童。本研究以西部某省份农村为例，通过文献研究和案例分析的方法，对农村留守儿童的教育福利政策与现状进行了研究。研究发现，由于政策法规的执行不够到位，教育条件有一定程度的缺失，留守儿童教育福利得不到有效最好的保障。本文提出，农村留守儿童教育福利的改进需要政府、学校和社会各界共同配合和参与。本文的研究为儿童福利、农村发展等相关领域的研究和实践提供了有益参考。</jats:p>", "DOI": "10.55375/jssc.2024.3.6", "type": "journal-article", "created": {"date-parts": [[2024, 1, 19]], "date-time": "2024-01-19T01:12:48Z", "timestamp": 1705626768000}, "page": "55-61", "source": "Crossref", "is-referenced-by-count": 1, "title": ["农村留守儿童教育福利的问题、挑战与改进 —— 以西部某省份农村为例"], "prefix": "10.55375", "volume": "3", "author": [{"name": "甘肃农业大学管理学院", "sequence": "first", "affiliation": [], "role": [{"role": "author", "vocabulary": "crossref"}]}, {"given": "睿文", "family": "李", "sequence": "first", "affiliation": [], "role": [{"role": "author", "vocabulary": "crossref"}]}], "member": "34204", "published-online": {"date-parts": [[2014, 1, 19]]}, "container-title": ["社会科学与计算研究"], "original-title": [], "deposited": {"date-parts": [[2024, 1, 19]], "date-time": "2024-01-19T01:12:48Z", "timestamp": 1705626768000}, "score": 1, "resource": {"primary": {"URL": "https://qingpress.com/zh-cn/articles/508"}}, "subtitle": [], "short-title": [], "issued": {"date-parts": [[2014, 1, 19]]}, "references-count": 0, "journal-issue": {"issue": "1", "published-online": {"date-parts": [[2014, 1, 19]]}, "published-print": {"date-parts": [[2014, 1, 19]]}}, "URL": "https://doi.org/10.55375/jssc.2024.3.6", "relation": {}, "ISSN": ["2789-553X"], "issn-type": [{"type": "print", "value": "2789-553X"}], "subject": [], "published": {"date-parts": [[2014, 1, 19]]}}}